</span></p><p class="Normal parashape-21" style="margin:0px 0px 0.75em;color:rgb(90,90,90);font-size:medium;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';line-height:1;"><span class="lang-other charshape-9"></span><span style="font-family:'Nanum Gothic';font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:rgb(0,0,255);"><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UdyJCd_7joUtqv17yxy7c9RckSpVusFR/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:rgb(38,33,99);text-decoration:none;">단행본 &lt;오션테크-바다의 미래를 만드는 신기술&gt;</a></span></p><p class="Normal parashape-21" style="margin:0px 0px 0.75em;color:rgb(90,90,90);font-size:medium;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';line-height:1;"><span style="font-family:'Nanum Gothic';font-size:16px;">▲ 위 글씨를 클릭하시면, 단행본을 다운로드 받으실 수 있습니다. </span><span style="font-family:'Nanum Gothic';font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:rgb(0,0,255);"></span></p>]]></description>
